    "value_range": "value_off includes tag byte; value_end_off is exclusive end of the entire value subtree.",
    "null": "NULL remains separate from zero, false, empty string and absent slots. Parameter lists preserve only encoded slots; omitted slots do not become invented NULL rows.",
